OL,3,APersonal attacks fire up debate before
OL,4,ABrazil's run-off vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazil's left-wing President, Luiz
OL,7,FInacio Lula da Silva, and his
OL,8,Fright-wing rival, Senator Flavio
OL,9,FBolsonaro, have clashed in a debate
OL,10,Fheld one week before the run-off
OL,11,Fpresidential election.
OL,13,FPolls suggest the two candidates are
OL,14,Fneck and neck and the televised debate
OL,15,Fwas hailed as a chance for both to sway
OL,16,Fundecided voters.
OL,18,FBut the showdown was marked by personal
OL,19,Fattacks and analysts have warned that
OL,20,Fits aggressive tone may increase the
OL,21,Fabstention rate further.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
