OL,3,APersonal attacks fire up debate before
OL,4,ABrazil's run-off vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the first round of voting, held on 4
OL,7,FOctober, Bolsonaro defied opinion polls
OL,8,Fby securing a narrow lead over Lula.
